<title>USA: NYC $815 mln bonds repriced, 2004 cut to 5.50 pct.</title>
<headline>NYC $815 mln bonds repriced, 2004 cut to 5.50 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co said Wednesday it repriced New York City's $815.4 million general obligation bond issue, lowering the yield in 2004 to 5.50 percent from 5.55 percent.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
