<p>RE: $815,350,000*</p>
<p>GENERAL OBLIGATION BONDS</p>
<p>FISCAL 1997 SERIES H</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>NOTE PRICE CHANGE FOR THE 2004 MATURITY ONLY.</p>
